        "sw" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Jibu la haraka zaidi linaonyeshwa kwanza na lile la polepole hulisasisha. Menyu inaorodhesha maeneo pale jibu linapokuwa halina uhakika, au kuna kadhaa; ulichokwishapita kinakaa pale kilipo. Zima kiwango ili kuokoa kumbukumbu na nishati."
